{
	"name": "Verdant Owl",
	"type": "object",
	"img": "icons/creatures/birds/raptor-owl-flying-moon.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Resembling a barn owl but green and covered in moss and tiny flowering plants, verdant owls are rare denizens of the deepest forests. Their small stature and emerald plumage means that they often blend in with the dense boughs of the ancient trees that make up their habitat. Druids who frequent these forests say that simply seeing one of these birds is a boon from the gods. Adventurers who succeed on a Perception check (DC 17) to spot a verdant owl in a nearby tree may reroll one ability check of their choosing in the next 24 hours.</p>",
